{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fastrak : Metro is a game where you drive trains on <i>real Australian railway lines!</i><br><br>The game places<i> you</i>\u00a0in control of trans on real Aussie railway lines! Drive on stylised recreations of suburban train lines across Australia, from Sydney to Perth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/extras/d2151bedb9825aa4f28c863b2e8ee25e.avif?t=1756360299\" width=1560 height=416 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring the Suburban Lines:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belgrave Line</strong> from Southern Cross to Ringwood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inner West Line</strong> from Central to Parramatta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fremantle Line</strong> from Perth to Fremantle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/extras/9bb00223aac190df683246f3c71096c0.avif?t=1756360299\" width=1560 height=416 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A huge fleet of rolling stock:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X'traps, Comengs, HCMTs, A Series, B series, C Series, K sets, T sets and M sets and<i> way more!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/extras/3a1224c183269cd20ddadea465d4a80c.avif?t=1756360299\" width=1124 height=634 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just control the power and brakes, follow speed limits, and stop right in place for maximum points! use XP earned to unlock new levels, with unique timetables, rare or strange sets, and themed environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated starting procedures, nor shunting, just jump in and drive!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918220?t=1756360299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/9c2950466daacd4193a8d598f6bdf628bc023677/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756360299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/6d208ec8beef89f3aae309782058c68ea56bdc0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756360299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/6d208ec8beef89f3aae309782058c68ea56bdc0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756360299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fastrak : Metro is a game where you drive trains on <i>real Australian railway lines!</i><br><br>The game places<i> you</i>\u00a0in control of trans on real Aussie railway lines! Drive on stylised recreations of suburban train lines across Australia, from Sydney to Perth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/extras/d2151bedb9825aa4f28c863b2e8ee25e.avif?t=1756360299\" width=1560 height=416 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring the Suburban Lines:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belgrave Line</strong> from Southern Cross to Ringwood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inner West Line</strong> from Central to Parramatta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fremantle Line</strong> from Perth to Fremantle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/extras/9bb00223aac190df683246f3c71096c0.avif?t=1756360299\" width=1560 height=